      "description_en": "The region ID of the instance. You can call the [DescribeRegions](~~25609~~) operation to query the most recent region list.",
      "description_zh": "实例所属的地域ID。您可以调用[DescribeRegions](~~25609~~)查看最新的阿里云地域列表。",
      "example": "cn-hangzhou",
      "help_en": "The region ID of the instance. You can call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html operation to query the most recent region list",
